# VDS deployment
MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=your_secure_password
ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Production
# Auth: shared mvv42-auth (cookie + JWKS), no app secret.

# Frontend: API prefix, same origin. Default /cashpulse → /cashpulse/api/… (nginx convention route).
# Local dev: leave unset; vite proxies /cashpulse/api and /auth (see cashpulse-web/vite.config.ts).
# VITE_API_URL=/cashpulse
